# The three images the deploy runs.
#
# Runtime-only images: the binary's shared-library closure and the data files it
# opens, and nothing else. None of them contains any configuration. PLMN, cell
# identity, the CU/RIC/core addresses, peer MACs and PCI addresses live only in
# the ConfigMaps mounted at run time, so these images carry no site data.
#
#   yoy-du-low   Aerial cuPHY, the L1.  aarch64, GPU host.
#   yoy-du-high  OAI MAC/RLC, the L2.   x86_64 -- a different machine, reached
#                                       over FAPI/DPDK rather than /dev/shm.
#   yoy-cu       OAI RRC/PDCP/SDAP.     aarch64.
#
# Override any of them in versions.local.env (untracked).
IMAGE_DU_LOW="${IMAGE_DU_LOW:-haytham/yoy-du-low:1.0}"
IMAGE_DU_HIGH="${IMAGE_DU_HIGH:-haytham/yoy-du-high:1.0}"
IMAGE_CU="${IMAGE_CU:-haytham/yoy-cu:1.0}"
